ADDITIONAL NOTICE ABOUT THE DATASET IMAGES

This licence covers the CODE of this repository only: the Java generators, the
checkers, the training and benchmarking code, and the documentation.

It does NOT cover the images of the dataset. Every image in the dataset was
produced by the project's own generators, but it reproduces the rendering of a
third-party Minecraft anti-bot plugin, and the licence of each dataset row is
the licence of the plugin it came from. Some of those plugins are licensed
under GPL-3.0 or AGPL-3.0, and for several of them no licence was granted at
all (all rights reserved).

The per-plugin breakdown is in docs/PLUGINS.md and docs/LICENSES.md; each
dataset row also carries its provenance in the "source" field of labels.jsonl.
Anyone using the dataset must comply with the licence of the plugin each row
came from.

Reference screenshots of third-party plugins (real_shots/) are not published:
they are not part of the dataset and not part of this repository.
